---
const testimonials = [
  {
    quote:
      'BSI Solutionz approached the installation with thorough planning and clear communication from start to finish. The team delivered on schedule without cutting corners, and their post-installation support was responsive, practical, and genuinely helpful. It is rare to find a contractor who follows through as well after the job as they do during it.',
    name: 'Atul Vardhman',
    role: 'Vardhman Group'
  },
  {
    quote:
      'From initial coordination through to completion, BSI Solutionz kept things organised and professionally managed. The installation went smoothly, and the level of support we received afterwards gave us real confidence in our decision. Knowing that the team remained engaged and available after handover made all the difference.',
    name: 'Sushil Kumar',
    role: 'SRB International'
  },
  {
    quote:
      'The installation was completed efficiently and the on-site team were straightforward and professional to work with. What stood out most, though, was how accessible they remained after handover. Any queries we raised were dealt with quickly and without fuss. That kind of reliability after the job is done says a lot about a company.',
    name: 'Om Prakash',
    role: 'Haryana Irrigation'
  }
];
---

<section class="section-pad relative overflow-hidden bg-[#F4F6F9] text-[#0D1F3C]">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(#d5dce8_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-size-[16px_16px] opacity-30 md:bg-size-[20px_20px]" />

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-8">
    <h2 class="font-headline mb-10 text-3xl leading-tight font-extrabold text-[#0D1F3C] sm:mb-12 sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">Trusted by Heavy Industry Leaders</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {testimonials.map((item) => (
        <article class="border-bsi-outline/30 bg-bsi-surface-lowest rounded-none border p-6 shadow-sm transition-transform duration-200 ease transform-gpu hover:-translate-y-1 hover:scale-[1.01] sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed italic text-[#4A5568]">&quot;{item.quote}&quot;</p>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0D1F3C]">{item.name}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#6b7280]">{item.role}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
